    "lore": "More than just the lightning-quick enforcer of Ionian balance, Kennen is the only yordle member of the Kinkou. Despite his small, furry stature, he is eager to take on any threat with a whirling storm of shuriken and boundless enthusiasm. Alongside his master Shen, Kennen patrols the spirit realm, employing devastating electrical energy to strike down his enemies.",
    "blurb": "More than just the lightning-quick enforcer of Ionian balance, Kennen is the only yordle member of the Kinkou. Despite his small, furry stature, he is eager to take on any threat with a whirling storm of shuriken and boundless enthusiasm. Alongside his...",
    "allytips": [
      "You can stun your opponents by inflicting 3 Marks of the Storm upon them.",
      "Lightning Rush can be used to initiate fights with its Energy return component, allowing him to use other abilities afterward.",
      "You can land an initial Mark of the Storm debuff on an opponent with Thundering Shuriken, and then add to it with Electrical Surge."
    ],
    "enemytips": [
      "Consider playing a bit more cautiously around Kennen when you have a Mark of the Storm debuff. If he hits you with 3 Marks of the Storm, you will get stunned.",
      "Kennen is flimsy by nature - turn and attack him if he gets careless with Lightning Rush."
    ],
