        "description": "Kennen morphs into a lightning form, enabling him to pass through units and apply a Mark of the Storm. Kennen gains Move Speed when entering this form, and attack speed when leaving it.",
        "tooltip": "Kennen turns into a ball of lightning, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">100% Move Speed</span>, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/120/160/200/240 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to enemies he passes through, and becoming Ghosted for 2 seconds. If Kennen damages at least one enemy, he gains 40 Energy. <br /><br />After this ability ends, Kennen gains <span>40/50/60/70/80% Attack Speed</span> for 4 seconds. Critical Strikes extend this duration by 1 second(s). Kennen can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to end this Ability early.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Ghosted units can pass through other units.<br />Deals 65% damage to minions and jungle monsters.<br />Duration cannot be extended beyond its initial value.</span>",
